(text "Adafruit 5795 / TL040HDS20-B1502A. Separate flex-mounted non-touch display installed by hand in J601." (at 16 155.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c0bb9e70-0a95-56fa-83cc-ad024fe2a29e))
(text "RGB565 drives the upper five red and blue bits and all six green bits. DB0 and DB12 are grounded." (at 16 160.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 549a310e-f5b0-58d0-8b29-8264ae379eb4))
(text "10k holds RESET low during host startup. 10k holds CS high. Place 33-ohm R605 at the host PCLK source." (at 16 165.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 07ed08e8-b665-5adc-9e53-462043753d6b))
(text "Y17B boots in RGB mode. Leave CS high after panel reset. No serial initialization table." (at 16 170.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 388c9376-eda1-511d-ba50-850a0673e51e))
(text "Use J601 pin 1 and the actual flex contact face to verify placement before applying backlight power." (at 16 175.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 62b3e14d-9242-5d95-86b0-46a314913868))
